**Update 12/24/2022**: This PR now rewrites almost all `lapce_data::completion::Snippet` methods (including changes from #1821). That was done:
- to avoid compiling the same regular expressions in a loop (see regex [`doc`](https://docs.rs/regex/latest/regex/#example-avoid-compiling-the-same-regex-in-a-loop) suggestion).
- to avoid allocation of many unnecessary vectors in the `Snippet::extract_text` function;
- to avoid allocating many unnecessary temporary strings in the `impl Display for SnippetElement` and `SnippetElement::text functions;
- to avoid allocating many unnecessary temporary strings in the `impl Display for Snippet` and `Snippet::text` functions;

Also removed the definition of `struct Snippet` from `lapce-ui/src/completion.rs` completely, as this structure is surprisingly not used at all in **`lapce-ui`**.

